    <projectSourceUrl>https://github.com/BADATCODING12345678910/AutoCorrect-Windows</projectSourceUrl>
    <tags>autocorrect grammar dictation productivity writing spellcheck</tags>
    <summary>System-wide autocorrect and dictation fix for every Windows app.</summary>
    <description>
AutoCorrect is a Grammarly-like tray app for Windows that works in every app.

Features include as-you-type autocorrect, Win+H dictation cleanup, snippets, clipboard fix, selection rewrite, privacy mode, and on-demand language packs.

14-day full trial. Lifetime and subscription plans available from the in-app License tab.
    </description>
    <releaseNotes>Privacy mode now persists across restarts (timed expiry or until you turn it off).</releaseNotes>
  </metadata>
  <files>
    <file src="tools\**" target="tools" />
  </files>
</package>
